<p>Mohsin(a.s) shaheed hogaya zehra(s.a) huin shaheed<br />
Darwaaza gira pehlu pe zehra(s.a) huin shaheed</p>

<p>1. Baade rasool Zehra(s.a) par wo zulm hogaya<br />
jis dar pa aake khud salaam karte the Mustafa(sws)<br />
Wo dar bhi jalaaya gaya zehra(s.a) huin shaheed</p>

<p>2. Saare farishte rote hain jibreel rote hain<br />
Sab momineen rote hain Hasnain(a.s) rote hain<br />
girya kuna hai kibriya zehra(s.a) huin shaheed</p>

<p>3. Haq e Ali(a.s) ke waaste khutba hua insha<br />
Ghasbe fidak nahi wo tha Haq e Murtuza(a.s)<br />
Haq Murtaza(a.s) ka chin gaya zehra(s.a) huin shaheed</p>

<p>4. Fizza se kaha Zehra(s.a) ne Quraa'n main padhti hoo'n<br />
Aawaaz jo sunti raho samjho main Jeeti hoo'n<br />
Aur na suno to samjho ke zehra(s.a) huin shaheed</p>

<p>5. Takfeen mein jo dekha ke tooti hai pasliyaa'n<br />
Saiha buland karke jo roye shahe zamaa'n<br />
haaye gazab ye hogaya zehra(s.a) huin shaheed</p>

<p>6. Soncho to zara <b>Meer</b> ye mumkin hai bhala Kya<br />
Atthara baras me hi lagti hai zaeefa<br />
Ummat ki seh ke har jafa zehra(s.a) huin shaheed</p>

<p>
<center><h3>Kalaam : Meer Kumail Ali</h3></center></p>
